WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.435
-The President is lying
about the Mueller report

00:00:03.435 --> 00:00:06.072
as his son, Don Jr., is facing
a congressional subpoena.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.207
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:12.778
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:15.315
Last night, President Trump
held a rally in Florida

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.516
where he once again lied
about Special Counsel

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:18.985
Robert Mueller's report,

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.753
which established
that Trump's campaign

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:23.123
had links to Russia
and benefited from

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.623
Russian interference
in the election

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:27.893
and that Trump repeatedly tried
to obstruct the investigation.

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:30.163
Remember? I mean every time
we talk about this story,

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.931
I have to restate
those basic facts,

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.599
facts that would,
in a sane world,

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:36.335
dominate the political landscape
for months, if not years.

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:38.104
Because everyone
keeps forgetting them.

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.605
And I'm not blaming anyone.

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:41.207
It's just
too much keeps happening.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.642
While we were talking about
the Mueller report,

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:45.678
we found out that Trump lost
over a $1 billion in 10 years.

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.281
This [bleep] is distracting.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.449
It's like going to book club

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.949
where everyone
read a different book,

00:00:50.949 --> 00:00:53.152
they all talk at the same time,
and instead of rosé,

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:55.655
people do uncut cocaine
while Skrillex plays.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:59.092
[ Laughter and applause ]
We can't focus.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:02.762
But the report was incredibly
damning for Trump.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:06.900
For one thing,
the report was 448 pages.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.501
If you went
to a parent-teacher conference

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:12.638
and the teacher said,
"Let me get your son's file,"

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:15.842
and it was 448 pages,

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.477
that kid's
going to military school.

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:18.912
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.714
But Trump's been lying about it,
and he did so again last night

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.816
when he claimed
that the report exonerated him.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:26.585
And he also claimed that
if he had investigated

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:28.687
anyone in the crowd
for two years,

00:01:28.687 --> 00:01:31.223
he could have found crimes
in their backgrounds, too.

00:01:31.223 --> 00:01:33.059
-Did you see what just happened,
by the way?

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.660
No collusion.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.661
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:35.661 --> 00:01:38.031
No obstruction.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:41.534
No anything.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:44.137
Two years on a witch hunt.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:46.072
I could've gotten anybody
in this audience,

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.873
I could've
found something on you.

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:51.444
-Wow, that is an interesting
new political strategy.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.712
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.181
Accusing your own supporters
of being criminals.

00:01:56.181 --> 00:01:59.318
He should start calling people
out like an insult comic.

00:01:59.318 --> 00:02:00.753
"Check out that lady.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.455
You telling me
you've never passed a bad check.

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:03.456
Look at her."

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.224
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.224 --> 00:02:07.760
"Big old fraud face."

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.862
For obvious reasons,
Trump wants to move on

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:11.697
from the Mueller report
as quickly as possible,

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:14.367
which is why he's waging
a war on Congress

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.769
to stop them from reading
the full, unredacted report

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:18.037
and all the underlying evidence.

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:20.640
Trump is also refusing
to hand over documents

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.409
and telling former aides
to defy subpoenas.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:25.678
He is fundamentally lawless,
which is not surprising,

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:28.514
because the guy spent his whole
life getting away with stuff.

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:30.850
If you left work
every Friday early

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.252
to go golfing with Kid Rock,

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:34.320
your boss would be like,
"You're fired."

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.222
And also, Kid Rock plays golf?

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.556
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.556 --> 00:02:39.558
Seems like a bowling guy.

00:02:39.558 --> 00:02:40.793
In fact,
at his rally last night,

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:43.062
Trump referenced a tweet
he had retweeted

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.097
suggesting that
he should get two more years

00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:46.532
added onto his presidency,

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:49.134
and in the process
of attacking the media,

00:02:49.134 --> 00:02:50.603
doubled down on the joke.

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:54.574
-They are a bunch of fakers.
There's no question about it.

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:57.777
But you know, in six years,

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:59.712
they're all gonna be
out of business, folks.

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:00.846
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:01.881
They're all
gonna be out of business.

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:04.584
[ Cheers and applause
continues ]

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:07.487
Now, if we want
to drive them crazy,

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:10.956
I'll say in 10 years,
they'll go crazy.

00:03:10.956 --> 00:03:16.129
"See, he is a despot.
He is a despot."

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:18.064
Well, 10 or 14.
Let's see.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:20.066
Whatever we like, right?
Watch.

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:21.534
It'll be headlines tomorrow.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:25.104
"Donald Trump
wants to break Constitution."

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.306
-You don't get credit
for predicting headlines

00:03:27.306 --> 00:03:29.208
that you created.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:31.410
You can't rob a liquor store

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:33.379
and then say,
"Watch the media tomorrow.

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.615
It'll say, 'Oh,
he robbed a liquor store!'"

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:38.251
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.687
"'He had a gun.
He was waving it around.'"

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.121
[ Applause ]

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:45.791
The Mueller report, it just
came out three weeks ago,

00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:47.860
and Trump already wants
to cover it up and move on.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:50.062
In fact, Trump is now citing
executive privilege

00:03:50.062 --> 00:03:52.498
to block the release
of the full, unredacted report

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:53.766
and all the underlying evidence.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:55.667
And yet he also keeps claiming
that the report

00:03:55.667 --> 00:03:57.804
he doesn't want anyone to see
exonerates him.

00:03:57.804 --> 00:03:59.305
And he did it again
during an event

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:00.873
at the White House
this afternoon.

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:03.175
-The report comes back,
it's perfect.

00:04:03.175 --> 00:04:06.178
It's beautiful.
There's no collusion.

00:04:06.178 --> 00:04:07.680
Nobody even
talks about collusion.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.083
Do you know, I haven't heard the
word "Russia" in a long time.

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:12.518
There's no more talk
about Russia.

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:15.487
What happened to Russia?
The Russian witch hunt?

00:04:15.487 --> 00:04:17.890
They don't talk about --
Because it was so on collusion,

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:21.760
which, by the way, is by far --
that's the big deal.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.596
'Cause it was all about Russia.

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:25.197
So I haven't heard
the word "Russia."

00:04:25.197 --> 00:04:26.965
They don't use
the word "Russia" anymore.

00:04:26.965 --> 00:04:29.202
-Just because you don't hear
the word "Russia,"

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:31.236
doesn't mean
no one else uses it.

00:04:31.236 --> 00:04:33.839
For one thing,
all you watch is Fox News,

00:04:33.839 --> 00:04:35.040
where I'm pretty sure
they pretend

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.675
Russia doesn't even exist.

00:04:36.675 --> 00:04:38.945
When they show a map
of Europe and Asia,

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:40.979
they replace Russia
with a graphic that says,

00:04:40.979 --> 00:04:42.448
"What about Hillary's e-mails?"

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:44.083
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.753
And yet no matter --
no matter --

00:04:46.753 --> 00:04:48.755
[ Applause ]

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:50.690
No matter how much Trump
would like to move on,

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.425
the investigation
is very much not over.

00:04:52.425 --> 00:04:54.159
In fact, we just
found out yesterday

00:04:54.159 --> 00:04:55.695
that the Senate
Intelligence Committee,

00:04:55.695 --> 00:04:58.864
whose chairman is a Republican,
had subpoenaed Donald Trump Jr.

00:04:58.864 --> 00:05:01.600
to come back in and testify
again about some of the details

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.769
in the Mueller report.

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:03.902
And speaking to reporters today,

00:05:03.902 --> 00:05:05.804
Trump made clear
he was not happy about that.

00:05:05.804 --> 00:05:09.108
-I was very surprised
to see my son --

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:12.545
My son's a very good person,
works very hard.

00:05:12.545 --> 00:05:15.848
The last thing he needs
is Washington, D.C.

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:18.284
Think he'd rather
not ever be involved.

00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:20.686
Remember, he said to me,
a long time ago

00:05:20.686 --> 00:05:21.887
when I was thinking
about running,

00:05:21.887 --> 00:05:23.922
"Dad, if I can help,
let me know.

00:05:23.922 --> 00:05:25.491
It's not my expertise.

00:05:25.491 --> 00:05:27.927
-Here's my question --
what is his expertise?

00:05:27.927 --> 00:05:29.362
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:31.897
Because it's definitely not
business, politics, speaking,

00:05:31.897 --> 00:05:33.699
spelling, writing, or standing.

00:05:33.699 --> 00:05:35.567
I mean, look at this.
Why --

00:05:35.567 --> 00:05:36.969
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:41.240
Why does this whole family
stand like a bunch of weirdos?

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.341
[ Laughter ]

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:44.243
Don Jr. looks likes
he's recording you

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:46.245
with a secret mic
strapped to his chest.

00:05:46.245 --> 00:05:47.447
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:50.049
"Could you say that
a little louder

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:51.818
and closer to my nipples?"

00:05:51.818 --> 00:05:58.857
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.857 --> 00:06:00.760
"So, the meeting
did take place?"

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.562
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.562 --> 00:06:06.132
So, Trump and his son
are both mad about the subpoena.

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:07.967
In fact, CNN reported
that one option

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:10.536
Trump Jr. is considering
in response to the subpoena

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:12.371
is to invoke
his 5th amendment rights

00:06:12.371 --> 00:06:14.674
and another is just
not to appear at all.

00:06:14.674 --> 00:06:16.842
And if that happens,
one Democratic Senator said

00:06:16.842 --> 00:06:19.679
they should enforce the subpoena
by any means necessary.

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:22.647
-If Donald Trump Jr.
defies this subpoena,

00:06:22.647 --> 00:06:24.317
he ought to be jailed.

00:06:24.317 --> 00:06:27.853
-Wow. I do not think Don Jr.
would fair well in jail.

00:06:27.853 --> 00:06:29.121
I mean, for one thing,

00:06:29.121 --> 00:06:32.024
can you imagine his hair
with only prison shampoo?

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:34.326
[ Laughter ]

00:06:34.326 --> 00:06:36.261
So, we just got the Mueller
report three weeks ago,

00:06:36.261 --> 00:06:38.230
and we're still waiting
for the full, unredacted version

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:39.799
as well as
all the underlying evidence.

00:06:39.799 --> 00:06:42.601
Now is when the Congressional
response should start, not stop.

00:06:42.601 --> 00:06:45.171
And yet Republicans want
to declare the whole thing over

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:46.939
and move on
as quickly as possible.

00:06:46.939 --> 00:06:49.541
-Robert Mueller's
witch hunt found nothing.

00:06:49.541 --> 00:06:50.809
And they were trying.

00:06:50.809 --> 00:06:52.712
Mueller is done.
It's over.

00:06:52.712 --> 00:06:55.114
-It's not even worth
talking about anymore.

00:06:55.114 --> 00:06:56.482
I'm done with it.

00:06:56.482 --> 00:06:59.018
-I'm not going to do any more.

00:06:59.018 --> 00:07:01.354
Enough already.
It's over.

00:07:01.354 --> 00:07:04.156
-The Special Counsel's
finding is clear.

00:07:04.156 --> 00:07:06.192
Case closed.

00:07:07.627 --> 00:07:09.595
Case closed.

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:12.464
[ Laughter ]

00:07:12.464 --> 00:07:14.300
-It's really funny when
the least interesting

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.936
man in the world takes that long
a dramatic pause.

00:07:16.936 --> 00:07:18.270
[ Laughter ]

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:21.941
He sounds like a ghost
drifting away in a graveyard.

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:24.744
"Case...closed."

00:07:24.744 --> 00:07:30.582
[ Laughter ]

00:07:30.582 --> 00:07:32.652
McConnell also said
in his speech

00:07:32.652 --> 00:07:34.587
that he wanted to finally
end discussion

00:07:34.587 --> 00:07:36.822
of the Russia investigation
once and for all.

00:07:36.822 --> 00:07:40.392
-That's what I want
to discuss this morning.

00:07:40.392 --> 00:07:44.362
Russia's interference
in American elections,

00:07:44.362 --> 00:07:50.002
the work of the Special Counsel
and the Attorney General

00:07:50.002 --> 00:07:53.673
and how we can finally end this
"Groundhog Day" spectacle.

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:55.274
-This isn't "Groundhog Day."

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:57.710
Every week,
we find out something new.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.544
If anything,
we have too much information.

00:07:59.544 --> 00:08:00.946
Following
the latest developments

00:08:00.946 --> 00:08:03.082
in the Russia investigation
is like trying to piece together

00:08:03.082 --> 00:08:05.484
the plot lines
of the last 20 Marvel movies.

00:08:05.484 --> 00:08:09.955
"Okay, so that guy told that guy
to fire that guy.

00:08:09.955 --> 00:08:12.225
But he said no
and told that other guy

00:08:12.225 --> 00:08:14.393
he was gonna quit
so he wouldn't go to jail

00:08:14.393 --> 00:08:16.996
like that other guy
who shared polling data

00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:19.298
with that guy
while that one lawyer

00:08:19.298 --> 00:08:21.433
was lying about
that other lawyer's deal

00:08:21.433 --> 00:08:23.002
with that other guy.

00:08:23.002 --> 00:08:24.470
And despite all this,
you're telling me

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.972
Paul Rudd hasn't aged a day
this whole time?"

00:08:26.972 --> 00:08:29.642
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:29.642 --> 00:08:32.511
The evidence is plain as day.

00:08:32.511 --> 00:08:33.812
It's right in front of us.

00:08:33.812 --> 00:08:35.781
In fact, this week,
hundreds of former prosecutors

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:37.450
signed a letter saying Trump
would've been indicted

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:38.584
if he weren't the president.

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:41.219
The letter is a nuanced,
in-depth legal argument,

00:08:41.219 --> 00:08:43.222
But it can basically
be summed up in two words.

00:08:43.222 --> 00:08:45.424
-Case closed.

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:48.560
Case closed.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:51.864
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:51.864 --> 00:08:53.199
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:57.069
[ Cheers and applause ]

